\description{
Connect measured metabolites that are linked to the same prior knowledge
(PK) terms, e.g. metabolites binding the same receptors in
\code{\link[=metsigdb_metalinks]{metsigdb_metalinks()}}, taking part in the same pathways in
\code{\link[=metsigdb_kegg]{metsigdb_kegg()}} or reported in the same cancer types in
\code{\link[=metsigdb_macdb]{metsigdb_macdb()}}. Node size and the number beneath each label show how
many terms a metabolite is linked to; edge width and labels show the
similarity of two metabolites.
}
